    "rationale": "Present risk is dominated by a property finding: the design has no hard spend, retry, runtime, step, or delegation limits even though it runs fully autonomously over 40,000 rows, retries incomplete results, and can recursively spawn researchers. Under rubric section 5a, the highest affected sink is S3 and the I-row base is high; the autonomy modifier applies but property findings are capped at high. Because no restoring structural controls are declared or verified, residual remains high. Forecast stays high because the design already lacks the controls whose absence creates the failure mode. Manual validation only; scripts were not available in this environment."
